3. Validating the response (important part)

You have 3 common ways:

Option A: Manual validation (simple projects)
def validate_user(data):
    if "user" not in data:
        return False

    user = data["user"]

    required_fields = ["id", "name", "contact", "skills", "orders"]

    for field in required_fields:
        if field not in user:
            return False

    if not isinstance(user["skills"], list):
        return False

    if not isinstance(user["orders"], list):
